@* US-069 FR-005.2: the one source of the eye control's markup. It starts hidden and has no name, value, form or id, so it
   adds nothing to a form and repeats freely; wwwroot/js/password-toggle.js reveals it. *@
<button type="button" hidden class="password-toggle" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="@T["Password.Toggle.Show"]" data-show-name="@T["Password.Toggle.Show"]" data-hide-name="@T["Password.Toggle.Hide"]"></button>
